    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ninja Ming</i> is a precision platformer with a teleportation twist. Play as Ming the ninja and take on the Path of Trial through 8 chapters and 241 levels.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dash? Flash! Teleportation is Key.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/a64b11fafa3a2058cd49d7e2e2918d88.poster.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/a64b11fafa3a2058cd49d7e2e2918d88.webm?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/a64b11fafa3a2058cd49d7e2e2918d88.mp4?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw a kunai and instantly teleport to its location! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Ming relies heavily on the move of teleportation. Once mastered, you\u2019ll be commanding the air and dashing through the challenging areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/d789edf75a71aff8ccbd722e02876d25.poster.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/d789edf75a71aff8ccbd722e02876d25.webm?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/d789edf75a71aff8ccbd722e02876d25.mp4?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Ninjutsu Skillset</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Flash&quot; is just the beginner skill! As you progress through levels, you'll unlock even more dazzling abilities: use &quot;ExFlash&quot; for long-range teleportation, destroy (or build) terrain with &quot;Fireball&quot; and &quot;Rock,&quot; and find creative solutions with &quot;Replacement Dash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each terrain presents unique puzzles - Use your skill combinations to plan the best routes and maximize your mobility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/0325f51c211f98df3f918c92838bcec3.poster.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/0325f51c211f98df3f918c92838bcec3.webm?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/0325f51c211f98df3f918c92838bcec3.mp4?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration + Puzzles = Scrolls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dashing forward, don\u2019t forget to explore\u2014each room contains collectible &quot;scrolls&quot;! Find different ways to unlock them - &quot;Flash Scrolls&quot; requires multiple Flashes to unlock, &quot;Treasure Chest Scrolls&quot; can only be opened with keys, &quot;Timed Scrolls&quot; tests your aerial ability, and &quot;Secret Scrolls&quot; are tucked away in corners.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ninja Ming\u2019s Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three years ago, with the appearance of a time-space rift, natural disasters struck the ninja world. Ninja Mirror and the Four Ninjas  sealed the rift together but were never seen again since. Three years later, a ninja named &quot;Ming&quot; inherits the will of the ninjas and embarks on his trial journey, searching for Mirror, and undergoing his own transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not have any form of stats growth. It'll only be you and your controls. Keep growing, and you shall master precision, speed, and style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/ef53a86b0486717e039b5838bae6b59e.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assist Mode</strong>: You can adjust the game speed to a minimum of 0.3x.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anecdotes</strong>: Keep track of your encounters and acquired ninjutsu.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>: Unlocks after completing any area. You will be timed in this mode. Welcome speedrunners! (Current world record for the first chapter &quot;Forest&quot; is 102.73s, held by Tichat002).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Controls</strong>: Precise control over movement and skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Respawn</strong>: Quickly respawn and resume the challenge after failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Areas</strong>: Forming the ultimate trial for aspiring ninjas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Electronic Music</strong> (by 4 Channels Club): Keeps your cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scroll Portal</strong>: Complete the first 4 chapters to unlock, and enter the next 4 chapters of Inner World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Achievements, and plenty of Easter Eggs!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ninja Ming</i> is a precision platformer with a teleportation twist. Play as Ming the ninja and take on the Path of Trial through 8 chapters and 241 levels.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dash? Flash! Teleportation is Key.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/a64b11fafa3a2058cd49d7e2e2918d88.poster.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/a64b11fafa3a2058cd49d7e2e2918d88.webm?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/a64b11fafa3a2058cd49d7e2e2918d88.mp4?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw a kunai and instantly teleport to its location! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Ming relies heavily on the move of teleportation. Once mastered, you\u2019ll be commanding the air and dashing through the challenging areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/d789edf75a71aff8ccbd722e02876d25.poster.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/d789edf75a71aff8ccbd722e02876d25.webm?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/d789edf75a71aff8ccbd722e02876d25.mp4?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Ninjutsu Skillset</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Flash&quot; is just the beginner skill! As you progress through levels, you'll unlock even more dazzling abilities: use &quot;ExFlash&quot; for long-range teleportation, destroy (or build) terrain with &quot;Fireball&quot; and &quot;Rock,&quot; and find creative solutions with &quot;Replacement Dash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each terrain presents unique puzzles - Use your skill combinations to plan the best routes and maximize your mobility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/0325f51c211f98df3f918c92838bcec3.poster.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/0325f51c211f98df3f918c92838bcec3.webm?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/0325f51c211f98df3f918c92838bcec3.mp4?t=1753423532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration + Puzzles = Scrolls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dashing forward, don\u2019t forget to explore\u2014each room contains collectible &quot;scrolls&quot;! Find different ways to unlock them - &quot;Flash Scrolls&quot; requires multiple Flashes to unlock, &quot;Treasure Chest Scrolls&quot; can only be opened with keys, &quot;Timed Scrolls&quot; tests your aerial ability, and &quot;Secret Scrolls&quot; are tucked away in corners.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ninja Ming\u2019s Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three years ago, with the appearance of a time-space rift, natural disasters struck the ninja world. Ninja Mirror and the Four Ninjas  sealed the rift together but were never seen again since. Three years later, a ninja named &quot;Ming&quot; inherits the will of the ninjas and embarks on his trial journey, searching for Mirror, and undergoing his own transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not have any form of stats growth. It'll only be you and your controls. Keep growing, and you shall master precision, speed, and style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/ef53a86b0486717e039b5838bae6b59e.avif?t=1753423532\" width=620 height=268 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assist Mode</strong>: You can adjust the game speed to a minimum of 0.3x.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anecdotes</strong>: Keep track of your encounters and acquired ninjutsu.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>: Unlocks after completing any area. You will be timed in this mode. Welcome speedrunners! (Current world record for the first chapter &quot;Forest&quot; is 102.73s, held by Tichat002).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Controls</strong>: Precise control over movement and skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Respawn</strong>: Quickly respawn and resume the challenge after failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Areas</strong>: Forming the ultimate trial for aspiring ninjas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Electronic Music</strong> (by 4 Channels Club): Keeps your cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scroll Portal</strong>: Complete the first 4 chapters to unlock, and enter the next 4 chapters of Inner World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Achievements, and plenty of Easter Eggs!</strong></p></li></ul>",
